# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The phone locked and left alone (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.lockidle, with charge=0 battery_say=1 cpuidle=1): the battery's
# current a minute on the home screen, then locked and dark for the rest -- what the phone draws doing nothing.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 60 button lock wait 600
